      "summary": {
        "nb": "Aker brygge er et område og et kjøpesenter i bydel Frogner i Oslo. Om lag 6 000 personer arbeider på Aker brygge til daglig, og rundt 900 har sin bolig her.",
        "en": "Aker Brygge, formerly known as Holmen, is a neighbourhood in central Oslo, Norway. Since the 1980s and 1990s, it has been a popular area for shopping, dining, and entertainment, as well as a high-end residential area. It was previously an industrial area."
